      "jcr:created": "Wed May 20 2026 20:36:46 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h2>A data-driven look at how NPWT and NPseal manage wound fluid to support effective, consistent healing of surgical incisions</h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Wound exudate plays a critical role in healing. However, when not properly managed, excess fluid can lead to complications, delayed closure and increased infection risk.<sup>1</sup> For closed surgical incisions, where exudate levels are typically low and short-lived, balancing fluid management is essential to supporting optimal outcomes.<sup>2,3</sup></span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu May 21 2026 19:20:38 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "bottomMargin": "3"
    },
    "cols2_1175001238": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Wed May 20 2026 20:45:48 GMT+0000",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed May 20 2026 20:45:48 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols2",
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Wed May 20 2026 20:46:10 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\">Inside this whitepaper, you’ll learn:</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">How NPseal is designed to manage exudate through absorption, negative pressure and evaporation</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">What simulated testing reveals about performance under fluid levels exceeding expected conditions (0.6 mL/cm²/day over 72 hours)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Why evaporation plays a critical role in fluid control, with up to 69–78% of fluid lost to evaporation over time in testing</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Key performance outcomes, including pressure maintenance, zero leaks, and low visible saturation across a 7-day simulated use period</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu May 21 2026 19:21:22 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
